WEBVTT


00:01:06.923 --> 00:01:09.645
Thanks to Zhou Qingquan,
the wounded Ip Man and his wife...


00:01:09.646 --> 00:01:12.388
managed to escape from Foshan.


00:02:47.729 --> 00:02:49.648
- Hong Kong, 1950
- Here we are, Brother Ip.


00:02:49.649 --> 00:02:51.954
- Hong Kong, 1950
- Sorry for all the hassle.


00:02:51.955 --> 00:02:54.100
Not at all.
We're from the same village.


00:02:54.101 --> 00:02:55.928
It's been vacated for
a few months only.


00:02:55.929 --> 00:02:59.097
I talked to the neighbors.
They're very nice.


00:02:59.098 --> 00:03:00.911
Thanks so much, Kan.


00:03:02.464 --> 00:03:04.703
See if it's suitable for
your martial club.


00:03:11.751 --> 00:03:13.931
It's pretty spacious.
Is it big enough?


00:03:13.932 --> 00:03:15.491
Enough.


00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.539
It's very spacious.


00:03:19.823 --> 00:03:23.078
Day 8


00:03:32.605 --> 00:03:34.235
Master Ip.


00:03:34.461 --> 00:03:36.821
You haven't recruited
any pupils today?


00:03:39.811 --> 00:03:41.316
What's the matter, Auntie?


00:03:41.317 --> 00:03:45.315
It's a big space.
Can I dry my clothes here?


00:03:45.737 --> 00:03:47.517
Please go ahead.


00:04:30.326 --> 00:04:32.019
Wing Sing!


00:04:32.474 --> 00:04:35.801
I told you to leave the
heavy stuffto me!


00:04:35.802 --> 00:04:38.840
You're pregnant!
You shouldn't do that!


00:04:39.295 --> 00:04:41.751
There'd be no more water
had I waited for you.


00:04:42.564 --> 00:04:45.469
Next time I'll be back sooner,
all right?


00:04:47.591 --> 00:04:50.015
I told you not to
exhaust yourself.


00:04:50.922 --> 00:04:53.282
Are you all right?
Feeling better?


00:04:55.213 --> 00:04:58.055
Mom, I need to pay my school
fees in two days.


00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:00.009
Wait.


00:05:06.715 --> 00:05:08.028
Who is it?


00:05:08.029 --> 00:05:10.010
Time to pay your rent!
Mr Ip! Mrs Ip!


00:05:10.011 --> 00:05:12.188
I don't have the cash.
Don't open the door!


00:05:13.571 --> 00:05:16.509
Mr Ip! Mrs Ip!


00:05:29.712 --> 00:05:35.086
Day 9


00:05:51.816 --> 00:05:55.234
No pupils yet today,
Master Ip?


00:05:56.236 --> 00:05:58.309
I'll dry my clothes then.


00:05:59.822 --> 00:06:01.515
Auntie.


00:06:02.386 --> 00:06:04.146
Let me help you.


00:06:04.148 --> 00:06:05.362
You help me?


00:06:05.363 --> 00:06:06.421
It's no big deal.


00:06:06.422 --> 00:06:08.368
Thanks.


00:06:30.285 --> 00:06:31.501
Hello!


00:06:31.502 --> 00:06:33.317
You teach Wing Chun?


00:06:37.012 --> 00:06:40.236
Master! Someone wants
to learn martial arts!


00:06:45.182 --> 00:06:46.429
You want to learn
martial arts?


00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.967
Just checking out.


00:06:47.968 --> 00:06:49.812
I don't know what
Wing Chun is.


00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.523
Let me give you
an introduction.


00:06:51.524 --> 00:06:52.866
As a matter of fact,
Wing Chun...


00:06:52.867 --> 00:06:54.405
is a close combat style
from the South...


00:06:54.406 --> 00:06:56.329
No need to tell me
all these.


00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:59.363
Let's fight. I'll pay you
school fees if I lose.


00:07:02.991 --> 00:07:04.649
OK.


00:07:16.379 --> 00:07:18.968
I'm Ip Man of Wing Chun.


00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.967
So?


00:07:37.296 --> 00:07:39.177
You haven't beaten
me yet.


00:08:04.939 --> 00:08:06.316
Are you ready to
accept defeat?


00:08:06.317 --> 00:08:07.758
Ready for what?


00:08:07.759 --> 00:08:09.638
I've no idea what
you're doing.


00:08:20.987 --> 00:08:22.549
Do you have some
idea now?


00:08:30.597 --> 00:08:34.375
Master Ip, I never knew
you're so great!


00:08:34.376 --> 00:08:36.134
Incredible!


00:08:37.293 --> 00:08:40.514
Young man, hurry and
accept him as your master!


00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:44.460
You can pay me the school
fees now, right?


00:08:51.034 --> 00:08:53.435
Why are you leaving,
young man?


00:08:53.436 --> 00:08:56.159
What to do now, Master Ip?


00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:58.626
You finally got
a potential pupil


00:08:58.627 --> 00:09:01.279
but now he's gone!


00:09:19.384 --> 00:09:21.163
That's him.


00:09:21.561 --> 00:09:23.898
Can this uncle be that
good in martial arts?


00:09:23.899 --> 00:09:25.114
Are you kidding me?


00:09:25.115 --> 00:09:27.678
He looks totally harmless.


00:09:27.679 --> 00:09:30.843
He actually resembles
a laundryman.


00:09:31.426 --> 00:09:33.819
You're not really here
to learn martial arts.


00:09:34.373 --> 00:09:36.001
Go away!


00:09:37.416 --> 00:09:40.868
OK! We're challenging
you to a fight!


00:09:41.131 --> 00:09:42.702
No need to take it off.


00:09:42.703 --> 00:09:44.305
What are you
talking about?


00:09:44.306 --> 00:09:46.218
Nothing.


00:09:48.533 --> 00:09:50.191
Asking Hand.


00:10:11.787 --> 00:10:13.895
I told you not to take
your clothes off.


00:10:13.903 --> 00:10:15.278
Master!


00:10:15.279 --> 00:10:18.249
Please accept me, Wong Leung,
as your pupil!


00:10:29.152 --> 00:10:30.620
- In that case...
- Master!


00:10:30.621 --> 00:10:31.548
I'm Tsui Sai-cheung.


00:10:31.549 --> 00:10:32.959
Ngai Kwok-hing.
Wong Kwun.


00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.771
Please accept us
as your pupils!


00:10:35.681 --> 00:10:38.425
I'm his first pupil.
You call me Big Bro.


00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.760
Pour some tea
for the Master.


00:10:40.904 --> 00:10:42.664
Forget the ceremony!


00:10:43.819 --> 00:10:45.697
Pay your school fees first.


00:10:45.995 --> 00:10:47.722
Pay your school fees first.


00:10:51.891 --> 00:10:55.408
Wing Chun combines
defense and attack.


00:10:55.767 --> 00:10:57.496
You attack and fight


00:10:57.497 --> 00:11:00.985
to beat your opponent
as quickly as possible.


00:11:00.986 --> 00:11:02.900
Look! This is "Dispersing Hand. "


00:11:03.712 --> 00:11:05.054
Dispersing Hand.


00:11:05.055 --> 00:11:07.961
Simultaneous defense and attack.


00:11:09.126 --> 00:11:10.718
Got it?


00:11:14.632 --> 00:11:16.641
Who is Master Ip?


00:11:17.964 --> 00:11:20.007
Master!
Master!


00:11:21.297 --> 00:11:24.617
Leung! Did you ask
them to come?


00:11:45.641 --> 00:11:49.344
Master, can you beat ten men
at the same time?


00:11:52.559 --> 00:11:54.603
It's better not to fight.


00:11:54.705 --> 00:11:56.275
Continue your practice.


00:11:56.276 --> 00:11:59.081
What if so many men really
come with weapons?


00:12:00.886 --> 00:12:02.766
Flee.


00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:09.942
You should collect school
fees from them.


00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.868
I know.


00:12:13.573 --> 00:12:15.713
You say that
all the time.


00:12:16.326 --> 00:12:18.433
I'll collect them later.


00:12:18.569 --> 00:12:20.202
Everyone, stop for a minute.


00:12:20.203 --> 00:12:21.901
What's the matter?


00:12:21.902 --> 00:12:23.789
Master.
Master.


00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.380
It's time to pay
your school fees.


00:12:27.378 --> 00:12:28.657
What is it?


00:12:28.658 --> 00:12:30.418
Time to pay your
school fees.


00:12:30.419 --> 00:12:32.627
Whoever with cash
can pay me first.


00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:35.926
Master...
Master...


00:12:36.956 --> 00:12:38.974
Master, I'll pay
2 dollars first.


00:12:38.975 --> 00:12:40.861
My mom is... short of cash.


00:12:40.862 --> 00:12:42.690
So I'll pay the
rest next time.


00:12:42.691 --> 00:12:45.027
Next time, then...


00:12:45.028 --> 00:12:46.147
Master, I only have
this much...


00:12:46.148 --> 00:12:47.742
Next time, then!


00:12:47.909 --> 00:12:49.919
Go home and eat!


00:12:50.344 --> 00:12:52.354
Thank you, Master!


00:12:54.253 --> 00:12:56.645
So little!
What should we do?


00:12:57.935 --> 00:12:59.715
I can't help it!


00:12:59.793 --> 00:13:02.514
You know the
economy is bad.


00:13:02.582 --> 00:13:03.862
When my pupils
ask me to help out,


00:13:03.863 --> 00:13:06.354
as their master,
I can only agree.


00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.467
We better ask the landlady
to cut us some slack.


00:13:09.468 --> 00:13:11.354
Sure, ask her to cut
us some slack.


00:13:11.355 --> 00:13:12.639
I accommodate you;
you accommodate me.


00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.325
Everything will be OK, right?


00:13:16.449 --> 00:13:19.039
Excuse me, two pieces of cake,
please.


00:13:20.581 --> 00:13:22.361
You want an egg tart?


00:13:22.456 --> 00:13:23.529
No thanks.


00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:27.432
Don't run!
Stop!


00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:28.463
You dared to steal
a roast duck?


00:13:28.464 --> 00:13:30.985
You asshole!


00:13:31.497 --> 00:13:32.594
Stop eating!
Give it back to me!


00:13:32.595 --> 00:13:35.341
Stop beating him...
Pay up!


00:13:35.342 --> 00:13:36.373
I don't have the money.


00:13:36.374 --> 00:13:37.847
I'll take your dad
if you don't pay up.


00:13:37.848 --> 00:13:40.248
No, please let him go.


00:13:40.249 --> 00:13:42.589
Give me!
No!


00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.581
Stop it! Stop it!


00:13:43.582 --> 00:13:46.387
Stop beating him!
What's the matter?


00:13:46.464 --> 00:13:48.096
He stole our roast duck!


00:13:48.097 --> 00:13:49.349
I'll pay for him!


00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:51.457
Give it back!
I'll pay for him.


00:13:52.583 --> 00:13:53.799
Let's go.


00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:54.952
Quan!


00:13:54.953 --> 00:13:56.715
Uncle Man, I know
where my dad is.


00:13:56.716 --> 00:13:58.342
Take me to him!


00:14:07.254 --> 00:14:09.100
He's here.


00:14:23.875 --> 00:14:24.837
Quan.


00:14:24.838 --> 00:14:27.884
He can't recognize anyone,
Uncle Man.


00:14:27.885 --> 00:14:30.762
The Japanese had put
a bullet in his head.


00:14:30.763 --> 00:14:32.873
He can't recognize
who you are.


00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:42.579
Quan.


00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:46.039
Quan, I'm Ip Man. Quan!


00:14:48.544 --> 00:14:50.081
Scram, you Jap!
Quan...


00:14:50.082 --> 00:14:53.694
Scram, you Jap!Scram!


00:15:14.714 --> 00:15:17.521
Let's go, Uncle Man.


00:15:22.079 --> 00:15:24.161
It's my fault.


00:15:24.162 --> 00:15:26.520
It's not yourfault, Uncle Man.
It's my fault.


00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:35.043
Let's go.


00:15:36.109 --> 00:15:39.333
He rather be homeless
than comes with me.


00:15:40.113 --> 00:15:42.539
So I stay here to keep
him company.


00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:48.112
When I manage to work
at a restaurant,


00:15:48.665 --> 00:15:51.004
I can give him some
leftovers to eat.


00:15:51.005 --> 00:15:54.587
Otherwise, he would
have to starve.


00:15:58.853 --> 00:16:02.140
Don't worry, Yau.


00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:05.757
We'll take care of
your dad together.


00:16:07.374 --> 00:16:09.647
I'll employ anyone
recommended by Ip.


00:16:09.648 --> 00:16:12.559
If you can write for me
for half the wages,


00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:13.749
you can start right away.


00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:14.739
No problem.


00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:17.457
Sit. I'll find someone
to give you some work.


00:16:17.495 --> 00:16:18.904
Please stay, Ip.


00:16:18.905 --> 00:16:20.475
Let's have some tea later.


00:16:20.476 --> 00:16:21.564
Thank you!


00:16:21.565 --> 00:16:23.825
You're welcome.
Take a seat.


00:16:24.415 --> 00:16:25.502
All right.


00:16:25.503 --> 00:16:27.073
Thank you, Uncle Man.


00:16:27.074 --> 00:16:30.242
You better work hard, Yau!


00:16:30.243 --> 00:16:31.587
I will.


00:16:31.588 --> 00:16:34.330
World Boxing Championship
Tournament in Hong Kong


00:16:41.005 --> 00:16:43.602
Wanna learn martial arts?
I take you there later.


00:16:43.603 --> 00:16:46.736
I practice Hung Kuen.
Learning from you?


00:16:51.546 --> 00:16:55.131
If not, then why did you
tear off my bill?


00:16:55.132 --> 00:16:57.055
I don't care who you are.


00:16:57.056 --> 00:17:00.722
Your bill was on
top of my poster.


00:17:03.879 --> 00:17:06.310
Want to know what
Wing Chun is?


00:17:06.311 --> 00:17:08.420
You want me to beat
you up?


00:17:14.833 --> 00:17:16.784
One on one.
I'm not going to bully you.


00:17:16.785 --> 00:17:18.548
- You guys don't interfere.
- OK!


00:17:18.549 --> 00:17:20.020
And no eyes or throat!


00:17:20.021 --> 00:17:22.230
Cut the bullshit.
I'm in a hurry.


00:18:09.509 --> 00:18:11.273
- Do you accept defeat?
- No!


00:18:11.274 --> 00:18:12.682
No?


00:18:12.683 --> 00:18:14.279
Do you accept defeat?


00:18:20.177 --> 00:18:23.431
The Dispersing Hands should stay
in the center.


00:18:23.732 --> 00:18:25.589
Relax.


00:18:25.590 --> 00:18:27.537
Relax more.


00:18:32.223 --> 00:18:33.855
Who is Ip Man?


00:18:33.856 --> 00:18:35.482
What's the matter?


00:18:35.649 --> 00:18:37.795
Your pupil Wong Leung
has injured our man.


00:18:37.796 --> 00:18:38.853
He's in our hands.


00:18:38.854 --> 00:18:41.057
Go pay your ransom in the
fish market Lee Hung Kee.


00:18:42.151 --> 00:18:43.845
Let's go!


00:19:53.871 --> 00:19:57.519
Lee Hung Kee


00:20:10.367 --> 00:20:12.093
Kei!


00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:22.281
You are his master?


00:20:22.282 --> 00:20:24.096
Correct.


00:20:26.607 --> 00:20:28.363
Mr...


00:20:28.402 --> 00:20:31.209
I think it's just
a misunderstanding.


00:20:31.284 --> 00:20:32.886
Let's talk.


00:20:32.887 --> 00:20:34.992
Can you release
my pupil first?


00:20:35.511 --> 00:20:37.271
Release him!


00:20:45.475 --> 00:20:48.064
Leung, are you all right?


00:20:49.542 --> 00:20:50.855
I'm fine.


00:20:50.856 --> 00:20:52.801
Why did you
injure him?


00:20:53.365 --> 00:20:56.589
He wanted to fight but wasn't as good
as me. I couldn't really help it, could I?


00:20:56.590 --> 00:20:58.094
What did you say?
I'm not as good as you?


00:20:58.095 --> 00:20:59.938
Take it easy!


00:21:00.111 --> 00:21:02.353
You're both young men.


00:21:02.422 --> 00:21:05.804
Injuries are inevitable
in friendly fights.


00:21:05.878 --> 00:21:09.497
I'll visit your master
and explain to him.


00:21:09.498 --> 00:21:11.066
May I know
who your master is?


00:21:11.067 --> 00:21:14.204
Doesn't matter.
He's better than you anyway.


00:21:15.425 --> 00:21:18.712
By the way, did you
bring the ransom?


00:21:19.235 --> 00:21:20.995
No.


00:21:23.944 --> 00:21:25.823
Take it easy.


00:21:27.661 --> 00:21:29.026
Beat him up!


00:21:36.501 --> 00:21:37.900
Master! Watch out
for your back!


00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:53.853
Strike him down.


00:22:44.279 --> 00:22:45.209
Master.


00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:46.640
Come!


00:23:40.977 --> 00:23:42.225
Leung!


00:23:42.226 --> 00:23:44.522
Master! I'm here!


00:23:55.393 --> 00:23:59.160
So you really can fight
ten men at once.


00:24:00.420 --> 00:24:02.366
Wait till we have
escaped first.


00:24:10.349 --> 00:24:12.010
Follow me closely.


00:24:15.636 --> 00:24:17.002
Follow me closely!


00:24:52.376 --> 00:24:54.256
Leung, let's go!


00:24:54.619 --> 00:24:56.050
Go!


00:25:01.985 --> 00:25:03.581
Jin Shanzhau?


00:25:15.408 --> 00:25:17.320
Don't move!


00:25:18.003 --> 00:25:19.783
What are you doing?


00:25:24.439 --> 00:25:25.848
Master Ip,


00:25:25.849 --> 00:25:27.663
you guys go!


00:25:34.947 --> 00:25:36.706
Thank you!


00:25:38.024 --> 00:25:39.781
Screw you!


00:25:40.359 --> 00:25:42.239
What's going on?


00:25:51.636 --> 00:25:53.328
Master!


00:25:57.532 --> 00:25:59.066
Have you caused
trouble again?


00:25:59.067 --> 00:26:00.410
No, Master!


00:26:00.411 --> 00:26:01.820
We were fighting...


00:26:01.821 --> 00:26:03.768
and he brought
his Master.


00:26:07.075 --> 00:26:08.703
Jin Shanzhau!


00:26:09.477 --> 00:26:10.755
You think you're in
charge here?


00:26:10.756 --> 00:26:12.199
Not at all.


00:26:12.200 --> 00:26:15.690
Mr Hung, let's talk.


00:26:15.691 --> 00:26:18.030
You're armed but you
want to talk?


00:26:18.031 --> 00:26:19.405
It's not that.


00:26:19.406 --> 00:26:21.935
This asshole stirred things
up on my turf.


00:26:21.936 --> 00:26:23.731
That's why I...


00:26:23.732 --> 00:26:25.750
Where's your turf?


00:26:25.751 --> 00:26:28.889
This road is mine,
so is that piece of dump.


00:26:28.890 --> 00:26:30.361
Come, say it again.


00:26:30.362 --> 00:26:32.404
Whose turf is this?


00:26:34.846 --> 00:26:37.216
It's all Mr Hung's!


00:26:37.217 --> 00:26:39.326
Get lost!
None of your business here!


00:26:54.291 --> 00:26:56.137
Which school are you from?


00:26:57.110 --> 00:26:58.902
How are you,
Mr Hung?


00:26:58.903 --> 00:27:00.310
I'm Ip Man...


00:27:00.311 --> 00:27:01.973
from Foshan Wing Chun.


00:27:02.075 --> 00:27:04.474
That's how it happened...


00:27:04.475 --> 00:27:06.460
Your pupil and mine
had a friendly fight.


00:27:06.461 --> 00:27:09.662
My pupil was too strong
and injured yours,


00:27:09.663 --> 00:27:10.626
but he...


00:27:10.627 --> 00:27:12.101
You mean Wing Chun is
better than Hung Kuen?


00:27:12.102 --> 00:27:14.695
I didn't mean that,
Master Hung.


00:27:14.696 --> 00:27:16.582
Who permitted you to teach
martial arts?


00:27:16.583 --> 00:27:17.897
Do you know the rules?


00:27:17.898 --> 00:27:19.465
I really don't know
the rules.


00:27:19.466 --> 00:27:22.253
You don't know?
Let me tell you then.


00:27:22.254 --> 00:27:25.263
You are to be open to
anyone's challenge.


00:27:25.264 --> 00:27:27.442
If you aren't beaten when
the incense burns out,


00:27:27.443 --> 00:27:29.484
then you are qualified
to teach.


00:27:33.787 --> 00:27:36.374
Those are the rules of the
martial clubs.


00:27:36.509 --> 00:27:38.486
You got it now?


00:27:44.709 --> 00:27:46.881
Cut the speech.


00:27:47.207 --> 00:27:50.944
Martial clubs have rules,
so do police stations.


00:27:51.307 --> 00:27:52.619
I'm arresting you for inflicting
injuries to others.


00:27:52.620 --> 00:27:53.708
One, two.


00:27:53.709 --> 00:27:55.533
Cuffthese two bums and
take them back.


00:27:55.534 --> 00:27:57.419
I have another pair here.
Take him too.


00:27:57.420 --> 00:27:59.251
- Me?
- Master!


00:27:59.252 --> 00:28:01.292
Go!
Go!


00:28:02.840 --> 00:28:04.531
Go!


00:28:06.041 --> 00:28:09.113
Take your stuff.
The foreigner is waiting.


00:28:17.701 --> 00:28:19.263
Sir!


00:28:20.232 --> 00:28:21.480
My friends!


00:28:21.481 --> 00:28:23.625
Welcome! Have a seat!


00:28:23.626 --> 00:28:26.052
You have a little something
for me?


00:28:31.730 --> 00:28:33.807
Your money stinks.


00:28:33.941 --> 00:28:35.818
But I like it.


00:28:36.697 --> 00:28:39.089
So how is the boxing
competition going?


00:28:39.482 --> 00:28:41.596
We sold a lot ofticket.


00:28:41.597 --> 00:28:43.071
It sells very well,
no problem.


00:28:43.072 --> 00:28:44.224
Well Done!


00:28:44.225 --> 00:28:47.544
What about manpower
and security?


00:28:48.034 --> 00:28:51.106
He asked you about manpower
and security.


00:28:51.337 --> 00:28:53.705
All taken care of.
No problem.


00:28:53.706 --> 00:28:55.627
Great! Thank you!


00:28:55.628 --> 00:28:59.111
What will be my cut
in this competition?


00:29:01.906 --> 00:29:04.361
Leave us first.


00:29:06.261 --> 00:29:08.949
Let me handle it.
I know how to negotiate.


00:29:17.281 --> 00:29:19.138
How much should we
give him, boss?


00:29:19.139 --> 00:29:21.126
You tell me.
I'll tell Master Hung.


00:29:21.127 --> 00:29:23.167
I'm not gonna talk about
that now, thank you.


00:29:24.999 --> 00:29:27.328
You've done well,
that's all.


00:29:36.434 --> 00:29:40.565
Don't worry. The cops are
just showing off.


00:29:40.759 --> 00:29:43.219
Everything will be fine
after the bail.


00:29:45.181 --> 00:29:49.561
Master Jin, so sorry to have
involved you today.


00:29:50.626 --> 00:29:52.322
So sorry to have involved
you today.


00:29:52.323 --> 00:29:53.316
Wait.


00:29:53.317 --> 00:29:55.654
This ear has been deaf
since it's hit by your rod.


00:29:55.655 --> 00:29:56.614
What did you say?


00:29:56.615 --> 00:30:00.000
I said so sorry to have
involved you today.


00:30:00.011 --> 00:30:01.420
That's all right.


00:30:01.421 --> 00:30:03.502
If you hadn't hit me
with a rod


00:30:03.503 --> 00:30:05.038
at the cotton mill that year,


00:30:05.039 --> 00:30:07.052
who knows what I'd be doing
in Hong Kong.


00:30:08.661 --> 00:30:11.281
Police! Open up!


00:30:12.378 --> 00:30:14.223
Open up!


00:30:16.186 --> 00:30:17.596
What's the matter?


00:30:17.597 --> 00:30:18.814
May I speak to
Ip Man's family?


00:30:18.815 --> 00:30:20.416
I am his wife.


00:30:20.417 --> 00:30:23.266
Your husband's arrested
for injuring others.


00:30:23.267 --> 00:30:25.211
Please bail him out
as soon as possible.


00:30:32.173 --> 00:30:35.688
Mr Leung!...


00:30:37.008 --> 00:30:37.969
Mr Leung!


00:30:37.970 --> 00:30:39.442
What is it?


00:30:39.443 --> 00:30:41.140
You have to save
my husband.


00:30:41.141 --> 00:30:44.908
I'm short of cash... to bail
him out.


00:30:46.169 --> 00:30:48.016
Wait for me.


00:30:48.732 --> 00:30:51.833
It's a pain to open martial
clubs in Hong Kong!


00:30:52.638 --> 00:30:56.387
Too many schools,
masters, and rules.


00:30:56.388 --> 00:30:57.669
And then there's this Mr Hung.


00:30:57.670 --> 00:31:01.086
He has too many men,
pupils, and money!


00:31:01.321 --> 00:31:04.455
So what?
You wait and see.


00:31:04.650 --> 00:31:06.598
I'll have my revenge.


00:31:06.862 --> 00:31:09.040
When I'm out,
I'll smash his fish stalls


00:31:09.041 --> 00:31:11.147
and poison all his fish.


00:31:12.278 --> 00:31:13.718
Don't you see...


00:31:13.719 --> 00:31:15.702
you sound exactly like them?


00:31:15.703 --> 00:31:17.482
Kid


00:31:17.752 --> 00:31:20.824
You were quite fierce
when you fought.


00:31:21.118 --> 00:31:22.876
Who's the kid?


00:31:22.877 --> 00:31:24.639
What make you think I'm a kid?
Leung!


00:31:24.640 --> 00:31:25.922
Watch your attitude!


00:31:25.923 --> 00:31:27.619
Master Jin is your senior.


00:31:27.620 --> 00:31:30.019
That's OK.
He's a young man after all.


00:31:30.020 --> 00:31:33.160
Look at him.
He's just like me in the past.


00:31:33.161 --> 00:31:36.299
If you want him to be good,
find him a wife.


00:31:36.300 --> 00:31:37.804
Like me,


00:31:37.805 --> 00:31:40.044
a family with a wife and kids


00:31:40.045 --> 00:31:41.859
will make one down to earth.


00:31:48.184 --> 00:31:49.944
I want to bail my husband out.


00:31:49.945 --> 00:31:51.451
Who's your husband?


00:31:51.452 --> 00:31:52.986
Ip Man.


00:31:52.987 --> 00:31:54.491
Do you have the money
with you?


00:31:54.492 --> 00:31:56.123
Yes.


00:31:57.539 --> 00:31:59.448
Ip Man.


00:31:59.745 --> 00:32:01.438
You can go now.


00:32:06.346 --> 00:32:08.158
Hurry up!


00:32:25.596 --> 00:32:27.486
I'm here to bail out
Jin Shanzhau.


00:32:27.487 --> 00:32:28.607
Honey!


00:32:28.608 --> 00:32:30.942
Brother, open the door
for me, please.


00:32:30.943 --> 00:32:32.442
Hurry up!


00:32:35.013 --> 00:32:36.795
My wife.


00:32:44.304 --> 00:32:46.028
Leung,


00:32:46.640 --> 00:32:48.882
is your family going to
bail you out?


00:32:50.261 --> 00:32:52.141
No.


00:32:57.117 --> 00:32:59.999
Don't worry, Master.


00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:02.359
They will release me
in a couple of days.


00:33:02.625 --> 00:33:04.700
Go first. Go.


00:33:05.316 --> 00:33:07.578
I won't see you off.


00:33:18.322 --> 00:33:19.825
Kan,


00:33:19.826 --> 00:33:21.779
I need to bother
you again.


00:33:21.780 --> 00:33:23.790
I want to bail
my pupil out.


00:33:24.855 --> 00:33:26.835
Is that all right with you?


00:33:28.155 --> 00:33:31.260
Brother Man, I... don't have
enough money.


00:33:31.261 --> 00:33:32.988
Master Ip!


00:33:33.056 --> 00:33:35.261
Wait, Master Ip!


00:33:36.066 --> 00:33:38.329
Honey, do you have cash?


00:33:38.439 --> 00:33:40.325
What do you need
cash for?


00:33:40.326 --> 00:33:41.928
It's emergency.


00:33:41.929 --> 00:33:44.103
You're always like that. No!


00:33:44.460 --> 00:33:46.784
Help me, Honey!


00:33:47.403 --> 00:33:49.840
- Come on...
- Last time!


00:33:49.841 --> 00:33:51.820
You're the best, Mommy...


00:33:51.861 --> 00:33:54.863
Take the cash, Master Ip.


00:33:55.125 --> 00:33:57.464
I'll pay you back as soon
as I can. Thank you.


00:33:57.465 --> 00:33:58.775
Don't worry!


00:34:08.036 --> 00:34:12.283
It's such a pain to open a martial club
in Hong Kong, let's forget about it.


00:34:19.599 --> 00:34:24.208
Just visiting other masters.
No big deal.


00:34:25.459 --> 00:34:29.262
I don't wanna fret over you,
like before.


00:34:36.671 --> 00:34:39.675
We've gone through everything
during the war.


00:34:39.779 --> 00:34:43.067
There's nothing to worry
about, right?


00:34:43.978 --> 00:34:47.623
Don't worry too much.
You had a busy day.


00:34:48.491 --> 00:34:50.534
Go to bed now.


00:35:06.173 --> 00:35:09.409
I fought in similar arenas
many times before.


00:35:09.410 --> 00:35:10.976
But it wasn't stools
underneath.


00:35:10.977 --> 00:35:13.220
It was all knives!


00:35:13.221 --> 00:35:15.046
Ip Man.


00:35:15.047 --> 00:35:16.678
Have you heard
of him before?


00:35:16.679 --> 00:35:18.952
The name sounds so lame.


00:35:18.953 --> 00:35:20.647
No, I haven't.


00:35:20.683 --> 00:35:24.270
Who can be better than
Master Law?


00:35:24.271 --> 00:35:26.662
You're being modest,
Master Cheng.


00:35:27.091 --> 00:35:28.561
Are you going up
later on?


00:35:28.562 --> 00:35:30.450
If you'll go, I'll go.


00:35:30.451 --> 00:35:31.861
Let's stop talking


00:35:31.862 --> 00:35:33.048
and have some tea.


00:35:33.049 --> 00:35:34.805
Thanks.
Thanks.


00:35:39.647 --> 00:35:41.305
Master.


00:35:46.274 --> 00:35:47.936
He has arrived.


00:35:53.707 --> 00:35:55.434
Masters...


00:35:55.920 --> 00:35:58.127
this is Ip Man.


00:35:58.449 --> 00:36:01.420
He wants to teach martial arts
in Hong Kong.


00:36:01.427 --> 00:36:06.327
So here he is to welcome
to your challenge.


00:36:06.328 --> 00:36:07.890
Ip Man.


00:36:08.186 --> 00:36:11.867
If you surrender or fall off
the desk, you lose.


00:36:11.868 --> 00:36:15.387
If you can stay put when
the incense burns out,


00:36:15.681 --> 00:36:18.210
I'll call you Master Ip.


00:36:18.211 --> 00:36:20.867
If there's no question,
let's start.


00:36:34.196 --> 00:36:36.402
No way, walking up like that?


00:36:38.105 --> 00:36:39.949
No style at all.


00:36:53.897 --> 00:36:56.844
Hello, masters! I'm Ip Man...


00:36:56.845 --> 00:37:00.013
of Foshan Wing Chun,
pupil of Chen Huashun.


00:37:00.014 --> 00:37:02.384
I'm honored to meet you!


00:37:02.385 --> 00:37:04.914
Which master wants to play?


00:37:04.915 --> 00:37:08.170
Master Law, what are you
waiting for?


00:37:08.600 --> 00:37:10.739
Let's see who wants
to go first.


00:37:19.522 --> 00:37:22.558
OK, I'll go first.


00:37:42.199 --> 00:37:43.699
Please!


00:37:43.803 --> 00:37:45.298
Please!


00:37:47.261 --> 00:37:50.581
Be careful, brother!


00:38:37.230 --> 00:38:39.761
Master Law, are you all right?


00:38:39.762 --> 00:38:41.618
I'm fine.
Master...


00:38:41.619 --> 00:38:44.906
If it were knives,
it would have been death.


00:38:45.144 --> 00:38:48.025
- One shouldn't fight like that.
- Go away!


00:38:48.026 --> 00:38:49.785
That desk is very
slippery indeed.


00:38:51.006 --> 00:38:52.574
Thank you for
letting me win!


00:38:52.575 --> 00:38:54.527
Come on! Don't let it stop!


00:38:54.528 --> 00:38:57.664
Master Cheng, your turn.


00:38:59.008 --> 00:38:59.972
Please!


00:38:59.973 --> 00:39:01.509
Master Cheng, go on up.


00:39:01.510 --> 00:39:03.270
Go.


00:39:10.768 --> 00:39:14.800
Master Cheng,
the desk is very slippery.


00:39:22.427 --> 00:39:23.990
Please!


00:39:24.894 --> 00:39:26.327
Please!


00:40:34.979 --> 00:40:36.444
Good!


00:40:45.455 --> 00:40:47.235
Thanks for sparing me.


00:40:47.313 --> 00:40:49.290
Thanks for letting
me win!


00:40:49.683 --> 00:40:52.141
Who else is interested?


00:41:38.757 --> 00:41:40.316
Please!


00:41:40.773 --> 00:41:42.499
Please!


00:43:33.497 --> 00:43:35.126
Master Ip!


00:43:35.127 --> 00:43:36.973
Master Hung!


00:43:38.301 --> 00:43:40.953
Welcome to the martial
arts society.


00:43:40.988 --> 00:43:43.416
Don't forget to pay
your monthly fees.


00:43:43.777 --> 00:43:45.153
What monthly fees?


00:43:45.154 --> 00:43:47.940
It's a rule.
Everyone has to pay.


00:43:47.941 --> 00:43:51.229
$100 a month.
It saves all the trouble.


00:43:56.366 --> 00:43:59.534
If anyone still thinks
I'm not qualified,


00:44:00.594 --> 00:44:02.539
I'm ready to accept
more challenges.


00:44:03.062 --> 00:44:06.161
But if it's only to satisfy
your personal gain,


00:44:06.616 --> 00:44:08.594
I cannot accept it.


00:44:09.851 --> 00:44:11.547
It's up to you.


00:44:11.548 --> 00:44:14.170
Don't look me up when
you have trouble.


00:44:15.170 --> 00:44:17.177
You can leave now.


00:44:30.350 --> 00:44:32.011
Medicine.


00:44:38.296 --> 00:44:40.948
Master, medicine.


00:44:51.269 --> 00:44:54.407
You wanna die?
Drawing on my newspaper?


00:44:54.408 --> 00:44:57.098
I just want the readers
to know the content better.


00:44:57.099 --> 00:44:58.976
Has the response been bad?


00:45:00.268 --> 00:45:03.340
Everyone in Hong Kong is talking
about Wing Chun Vs Hung Kuen.


00:45:03.729 --> 00:45:04.816
That's awesome!


00:45:04.817 --> 00:45:07.092
Keep writing in this style.


00:45:07.093 --> 00:45:08.662
My paper depends on you.


00:45:08.663 --> 00:45:10.002
Get to work.


00:45:10.003 --> 00:45:12.089
Awesome, Yau!


00:45:12.090 --> 00:45:13.586
Incredible!


00:45:14.684 --> 00:45:19.677
Wing Chun Vs Hung Kuen:
No Clear Winner Yet


00:45:23.652 --> 00:45:26.722
Don't do your homework.
Eat first.


00:45:26.920 --> 00:45:28.070
Let's eat.


00:45:28.071 --> 00:45:30.211
Please give me some congee,
Honey.


00:45:31.595 --> 00:45:35.046
You've been eating less lately.
Come and eat.


00:45:35.184 --> 00:45:36.615
Eat.


00:45:38.069 --> 00:45:39.317
Where're you going?


00:45:39.318 --> 00:45:40.885
Didn't you see?


00:45:40.886 --> 00:45:42.864
I'm going upstairs to wash
the tablecloth.


00:45:43.000 --> 00:45:44.919
You're really going to wash
the tablecloth?


00:45:44.920 --> 00:45:46.842
Of course, why else
this big bowl?


00:45:46.843 --> 00:45:47.996
You think I'm washing
my hair?


00:45:47.997 --> 00:45:49.949
151, 152...


00:45:49.950 --> 00:45:51.584
Where are you going?


00:45:51.585 --> 00:45:53.119
To learn Wing Chun.


00:45:53.120 --> 00:45:55.332
Wing Chun?
There's nothing here!


00:45:55.333 --> 00:45:56.612
Not according to the newspaper.


00:45:56.613 --> 00:45:58.726
Nothing! Scram!


00:45:58.727 --> 00:46:00.059
You better learn Hung Kuen.


00:46:01.513 --> 00:46:03.724
The scumbags won't let others
learn Wing Chun?


00:46:03.725 --> 00:46:06.189
Scumbags, I dare you
to come down!


00:46:06.190 --> 00:46:07.760
What are you doing?


00:46:07.761 --> 00:46:11.756
Didn't you hear?
Come down!


00:46:13.173 --> 00:46:14.801
Come down if you have guts!


00:46:22.399 --> 00:46:23.743
Come down if you dare!


00:46:23.744 --> 00:46:25.654
Are you crazy?
You wanna die?


00:46:25.655 --> 00:46:26.724
No guts?


00:46:26.725 --> 00:46:27.814
They want to learn
Wing Chun.


00:46:27.815 --> 00:46:29.992
- What are you doing?
- Beat him up!


00:46:33.417 --> 00:46:34.377
They've come down.


00:46:34.378 --> 00:46:35.874
Take your weapons.
Hurry up!


00:46:37.550 --> 00:46:38.916
Come out!


00:47:22.203 --> 00:47:25.147
This incident affected
our neighborhood.


00:47:25.148 --> 00:47:26.142
I understand.


00:47:26.143 --> 00:47:28.928
We've decided not to
lend you the rooftop.


00:47:28.929 --> 00:47:30.275
I understand.
I'm sorry.


00:47:30.276 --> 00:47:32.897
Sorry, I got to go.


00:47:37.035 --> 00:47:38.027
Farewell.


00:47:38.028 --> 00:47:39.972
Bye, Kan.


00:48:06.856 --> 00:48:08.549
Master.


00:48:10.057 --> 00:48:11.718
Master.


00:48:17.233 --> 00:48:19.495
I guess you know already?


00:48:22.038 --> 00:48:24.760
We can't practice
here anymore.


00:48:24.761 --> 00:48:26.939
Master, it's not our fault.


00:48:26.940 --> 00:48:28.188
They started it!


00:48:28.189 --> 00:48:30.238
They provoked us to go down.


00:48:30.239 --> 00:48:31.392
Let's go and reason with him!


00:48:31.393 --> 00:48:33.087
Good!


00:48:34.019 --> 00:48:35.448
Master...


00:48:35.588 --> 00:48:37.572
Tidy up the place
before you go.


00:48:37.573 --> 00:48:39.303
Move the wooden stakes
to my place.


00:48:39.304 --> 00:48:42.307
Master...
Master...


00:48:57.691 --> 00:48:59.415
Kei.


00:49:00.796 --> 00:49:02.687
Everyone's worked hard
for the competition.


00:49:02.688 --> 00:49:04.094
Share this with everyone.


00:49:04.095 --> 00:49:05.973
Thank you, Master!


00:49:08.486 --> 00:49:10.394
For you.
Thanks.


00:49:10.469 --> 00:49:12.249
Thanks for your hard work.


00:49:13.388 --> 00:49:15.198
How dare you come here?


00:49:22.129 --> 00:49:23.955
I'm here for your master.


00:49:23.956 --> 00:49:25.647
Kei.


00:49:26.135 --> 00:49:28.046
Take a break.


00:49:37.666 --> 00:49:39.513
What is it?


00:49:39.717 --> 00:49:41.628
Trouble at the martial club?


00:49:42.055 --> 00:49:45.610
I'm here to tell you
though I've lost my club,


00:49:45.611 --> 00:49:47.691
I will continue to teach
martial arts.


00:49:47.692 --> 00:49:49.773
I'm not doing to
pay a penny to you!


00:49:49.774 --> 00:49:51.310
Don't harass my pupils


00:49:51.311 --> 00:49:53.424
or cause others trouble!


00:49:53.425 --> 00:49:55.314
It's you who's causing
me trouble now!


00:49:55.315 --> 00:49:57.044
You don't follow the rules!


00:49:57.045 --> 00:49:59.255
Without me as the go-between
with the expats,


00:49:59.256 --> 00:50:02.779
how can martial clubs
here exist in peace?


00:50:02.780 --> 00:50:05.084
You choose to compromise
with the expats.


00:50:05.085 --> 00:50:06.622
Ip Man,


00:50:06.623 --> 00:50:08.731
you only care
about yourself.


00:50:08.803 --> 00:50:11.104
You don't have 200 men
to feed.


00:50:11.105 --> 00:50:14.941
You can ignore the expats
and play noble.


00:50:18.121 --> 00:50:21.256
I know your feelings.
We're trying to survive.


00:50:21.261 --> 00:50:23.149
But as masters,


00:50:23.150 --> 00:50:26.186
we should teach
our pupils well.


00:50:27.187 --> 00:50:29.363
My conscience is clear!


00:50:29.364 --> 00:50:31.659
At any rate...


00:50:31.992 --> 00:50:34.718
if you got any complaints,
come to me directly!


00:50:34.719 --> 00:50:36.668
- So long!
- Stop!


00:50:36.669 --> 00:50:38.911
You think you can leave
just like this?


00:50:38.912 --> 00:50:40.608
Then what do you want?


00:50:40.609 --> 00:50:43.483
We were not done last time.
Let's carry on.


00:50:53.517 --> 00:50:55.363
Be careful!


00:50:59.635 --> 00:51:02.870
Honey, we've been waiting
here for a while.


00:51:02.871 --> 00:51:04.375
The kids are hungry.


00:51:04.376 --> 00:51:06.585
Are you guys done
with your discussion?


00:51:19.593 --> 00:51:21.066
Master Hung,


00:51:21.067 --> 00:51:23.457
is it more important to win


00:51:23.691 --> 00:51:26.148
than to have dinner
with your family?


00:51:31.121 --> 00:51:32.243
What do you want to eat?


00:51:32.244 --> 00:51:34.933
We want ice cream!


00:51:34.934 --> 00:51:37.142
I'll buy you ice cream
after dinner.


00:51:42.239 --> 00:51:44.630
I won't hold you anymore,
Master Hung.


00:51:47.075 --> 00:51:48.800
Farewell.


00:52:07.671 --> 00:52:08.696
Master.


00:52:08.697 --> 00:52:10.194
Come in.


00:52:10.394 --> 00:52:12.021
Come in.


00:52:12.510 --> 00:52:14.269
Put them there.


00:52:14.557 --> 00:52:16.318
Come, put them there.


00:52:16.319 --> 00:52:18.526
Why did you bring the
wooden stakes back?


00:52:19.203 --> 00:52:22.661
They've rented the rooftop
to someone else.


00:52:22.662 --> 00:52:25.219
So I'm storing them
here for the time being.


00:52:31.278 --> 00:52:33.006
OK,


00:52:33.137 --> 00:52:34.704
go back and rest.


00:52:34.705 --> 00:52:36.627
Come here to practice
tomorrow morning.


00:52:36.628 --> 00:52:37.685
Come here to practice?


00:52:37.686 --> 00:52:40.144
Yes! Come earlier tomorrow.


00:52:40.855 --> 00:52:43.894
Goodbye, Master.


00:52:51.779 --> 00:52:53.540
Master,


00:52:53.541 --> 00:52:55.746
can I have a word
with you?


00:53:03.023 --> 00:53:05.445
Leung, have a cup of tea first.


00:53:05.809 --> 00:53:07.689
Come.


00:53:10.967 --> 00:53:12.747
Have a seat.


00:53:18.301 --> 00:53:21.056
Master, my impulsiveness


00:53:21.057 --> 00:53:23.778
has cost you your martial club.
I'm sorry.


00:53:23.779 --> 00:53:25.092
Come.


00:53:25.093 --> 00:53:27.398
Get up. Come.


00:53:27.399 --> 00:53:29.343
Get up.


00:53:29.863 --> 00:53:32.224
Sit down and we'll talk. Come.


00:53:40.691 --> 00:53:42.293
Leung,


00:53:42.294 --> 00:53:44.654
how's my martial arts?


00:53:45.273 --> 00:53:46.866
Of course it's great.


00:53:47.194 --> 00:53:48.155
You can beat so many people
by yourself.


00:53:48.156 --> 00:53:50.581
What about twenty years later?


00:53:51.935 --> 00:53:54.591
In twenty years,
you can beat me easily.


00:53:56.486 --> 00:53:58.789
Everyone will get old.


00:53:58.790 --> 00:54:01.529
No one can remain No. 1 forever!


00:54:02.988 --> 00:54:04.962
Leung, you have
great potential...


00:54:05.388 --> 00:54:07.267
for martial arts.


00:54:07.792 --> 00:54:09.392
But you only focus on...


00:54:09.393 --> 00:54:12.134
techniques.


00:54:12.821 --> 00:54:15.148
I want you to learn Chinese
martial arts,


00:54:15.990 --> 00:54:19.259
because they incorporate
the Chinese spirit


00:54:19.260 --> 00:54:21.335
as well as self-cultivation.


00:54:23.134 --> 00:54:27.133
It's important to be neutral,
striving not to strive.


00:54:32.904 --> 00:54:34.880
Do you understand?


00:54:37.966 --> 00:54:40.107
I'm thinking.


00:54:44.246 --> 00:54:46.350
You want to hear a story?


00:54:48.599 --> 00:54:52.018
That Jin Shanzhao,
Master Jin...


00:54:52.091 --> 00:54:53.500
Once upon a time...


00:54:53.501 --> 00:54:57.150
I whipped his ass
with a broomstick.


00:54:57.858 --> 00:55:01.411
He came to my house in Foshan
to challenge me to a duel.


00:55:01.412 --> 00:55:03.239
And he broke everything,


00:55:03.240 --> 00:55:06.406
making my wife really mad.


00:55:21.433 --> 00:55:23.258
Look, martial arts!


00:55:23.259 --> 00:55:24.722
Yes.


00:55:25.018 --> 00:55:28.055
Play over there, kiddies.


00:55:28.607 --> 00:55:30.483
Let's go.


00:55:42.189 --> 00:55:43.689
Master.


00:55:48.050 --> 00:55:49.994
Carry on!


00:55:57.981 --> 00:55:59.826
What a coincidence!


00:56:00.381 --> 00:56:02.229
I just happened to pass by.


00:56:03.651 --> 00:56:06.074
What do you want,
Master Hung?


00:56:07.526 --> 00:56:09.768
I have extra tickets.


00:56:09.769 --> 00:56:11.690
You want to go?


00:56:11.691 --> 00:56:13.669
It's western boxing.


00:56:19.059 --> 00:56:20.818
Goodbye.


00:56:21.526 --> 00:56:23.217
My Hung.


00:56:25.016 --> 00:56:27.572
Your eyes are red.. Are you OK?


00:56:28.026 --> 00:56:30.106
They've been like that
since I woke up.


00:56:30.107 --> 00:56:33.659
Perhaps it's the heat.
I'll drink some cool tea.


00:56:33.762 --> 00:56:35.999
It's not bad to teach
martial arts here.


00:56:45.807 --> 00:56:47.663
Move them over here
in three rows.


00:56:47.664 --> 00:56:49.329
And three rows over
there as well.


00:56:49.330 --> 00:56:50.856
Hurry up.


00:56:56.888 --> 00:56:58.515
So here we are!


00:56:59.130 --> 00:57:01.370
Master Hung, come say hi.


00:57:01.371 --> 00:57:03.101
I'll introduce you to the
boxing champion.


00:57:03.102 --> 00:57:05.150
Mr Twister.


00:57:05.151 --> 00:57:07.584
He's Chinese kung-fu master,
Master Hung.


00:57:07.585 --> 00:57:09.400
How are you?


00:57:12.009 --> 00:57:14.695
The foreigner is throwing things.
Ignore him.


00:57:16.395 --> 00:57:18.220
How's your talk with
the foreigner?


00:57:18.221 --> 00:57:20.428
When are we getting
our money?


00:57:20.689 --> 00:57:23.473
He glared whenever I touched
on money.


00:57:23.474 --> 00:57:25.234
Then it won't lead to anywhere.


00:57:25.235 --> 00:57:27.157
He asked to do a pro bono
this time.


00:57:27.158 --> 00:57:28.598
Pro bono?


00:57:28.599 --> 00:57:31.445
We closed our fish stalls
to work here.


00:57:31.446 --> 00:57:33.884
Don't get mad.
We can't afford to piss him off.


00:57:33.885 --> 00:57:35.861
Just treat this as a diet and
lose some weight.


00:57:38.819 --> 00:57:40.662
That's not his first time.


00:57:40.740 --> 00:57:42.520
Master Hung.


00:57:44.202 --> 00:57:45.894
Sir.


00:57:46.440 --> 00:57:47.529
You can refuse to pay,


00:57:47.530 --> 00:57:49.922
but my men need to eat,
so you better pay.


00:57:49.965 --> 00:57:52.461
Don't discuss money
with me now.


00:57:52.462 --> 00:57:54.320
What else can I discuss
with you? Love?


00:57:54.321 --> 00:57:55.633
Who do you think you are?


00:57:55.634 --> 00:57:58.196
You collect money for me,
you don't share it!


00:57:58.197 --> 00:57:59.285
Do as I say,


00:57:59.286 --> 00:58:01.399
you are not qualified to make
deals with me!


00:58:01.400 --> 00:58:03.245
Come!


00:58:03.993 --> 00:58:06.714
Sorry, so I'll have judges...


00:58:06.717 --> 00:58:08.670
Stop it. The foreigner devil
is pissed off.


00:58:08.671 --> 00:58:10.111
If he doesn't pay,
we'll just quit!


00:58:10.112 --> 00:58:13.317
If you quit, you quit that
fish business too!


00:58:13.318 --> 00:58:15.335
I can get anybody
to take care of it!


00:58:15.336 --> 00:58:17.222
OK! No problem!


00:58:17.223 --> 00:58:18.247
If you quit,


00:58:18.248 --> 00:58:20.234
he'd take away your fish stalls.
Just hang in there.


00:58:20.235 --> 00:58:22.219
No way! I've tolerated
him too often!


00:58:22.220 --> 00:58:26.514
Will somebody get this yellow piece
of fat out of here!


00:58:26.515 --> 00:58:27.951
You're making too much noise!


00:58:27.952 --> 00:58:29.616
Are you speaking the
Devil's tongue?


00:58:29.617 --> 00:58:31.124
You! Get out!


00:58:31.125 --> 00:58:33.137
OK! We go!


00:58:36.474 --> 00:58:38.933
I can't hear the Devil's squeal.
Let's go!


00:58:39.198 --> 00:58:41.312
- We're quitting. Let's go.
- Let's go! Let's go!


00:58:41.313 --> 00:58:43.126
Wait!


00:58:43.298 --> 00:58:46.684
Look, many lives
depend on you.


00:58:49.223 --> 00:58:51.201
Stay and work.


00:58:53.613 --> 00:58:55.872
Come,


00:58:59.154 --> 00:59:01.130
let's go!


00:59:02.005 --> 00:59:04.404
Don't be mad.
Let's wait and see


00:59:04.405 --> 00:59:06.449
where that asshole
will end up.


00:59:32.242 --> 00:59:33.525
Master Ip.
Master Hung.


00:59:33.526 --> 00:59:35.059
Thanks for your tickets.


00:59:35.060 --> 00:59:37.719
The other schools will have
demos later.


00:59:37.720 --> 00:59:39.899
Ask your pupils to demonstrate
their kung fu


00:59:39.900 --> 00:59:43.067
so more people will know
about Wing Chun.


00:59:43.648 --> 00:59:45.207
Sure.


00:59:45.281 --> 00:59:46.840
I won't be holding you.


00:59:50.852 --> 00:59:52.453
Hi, fellas!


00:59:52.454 --> 00:59:53.820
Hello there, Taylor.


00:59:54.216 --> 00:59:55.848
Congratulations!
Barely broke into a sweat!


00:59:55.849 --> 00:59:57.414
I thank you!


01:00:01.262 --> 01:00:03.623
Go get ready.
Go get ready.


01:00:04.017 --> 01:00:05.832
You go too, both of you.


01:00:07.415 --> 01:00:09.655
Go up and demonstrate
Shaking Hands.


01:00:10.040 --> 01:00:11.636
Together.


01:00:12.475 --> 01:00:14.013
It's quite good.


01:00:14.014 --> 01:00:17.114
Suffer some losses to publicize
martial arts.


01:00:21.954 --> 01:00:23.998
What's all this,
some pantomime?


01:00:24.070 --> 01:00:25.767
Why are they dancing
and screaming?


01:00:25.768 --> 01:00:28.040
It's not pantomime, Taylor.


01:00:28.041 --> 01:00:30.149
This is Chinese boxing.


01:00:30.316 --> 01:00:33.540
They believe the screaming
gives them strength.


01:00:37.075 --> 01:00:38.133
Oh, yeah?


01:00:38.134 --> 01:00:40.564
Well let's go and give them something
to scream about, ain't I?


01:00:40.565 --> 01:00:42.193
Go for it.


01:00:43.708 --> 01:00:45.715
Chinese boxing...


01:00:58.442 --> 01:01:01.481
Ladies and gentlemen, it looks like
Twister wants to get in on the action.


01:01:01.482 --> 01:01:05.382
Boxing Champion
Vs Chinese Kung-fu is cool!


01:01:12.695 --> 01:01:15.917
Thank you! Thank you...


01:01:16.955 --> 01:01:18.681
Very nice!


01:01:20.543 --> 01:01:22.267
Punch me.


01:01:23.906 --> 01:01:27.074
Punch... me.


01:01:35.757 --> 01:01:38.182
Hit me!


01:01:45.786 --> 01:01:48.626
More power! Come on!


01:01:51.965 --> 01:01:54.709
Come on! Come on!


01:01:57.668 --> 01:01:59.547
Come on!


01:02:10.191 --> 01:02:12.660
Nowthat is power!


01:02:12.661 --> 01:02:14.442
Bloody Foreign Devil!


01:02:15.734 --> 01:02:17.840
What's the matter?


01:02:25.311 --> 01:02:28.052
So this is Chinese boxing?


01:02:28.417 --> 01:02:30.657
You should stick to dancing.


01:02:30.659 --> 01:02:32.934
The Champion said Chinese
Kung-fu was useless.


01:02:32.935 --> 01:02:34.277
Go back to dancing.


01:02:34.278 --> 01:02:36.770
- What did you say?
- What did you say?


01:02:37.773 --> 01:02:39.467
Come on!


01:03:02.085 --> 01:03:03.483
Come on!


01:03:15.376 --> 01:03:17.222
Stop beating him! Stop it!


01:03:18.006 --> 01:03:20.244
Carry him out!
Stop fighting! Stop it!


01:03:20.245 --> 01:03:22.507
Stop fighting! Stop it!


01:03:24.154 --> 01:03:25.691
What should we do?


01:03:25.692 --> 01:03:29.143
Relax Fatso!
Enjoy the show!


01:03:31.136 --> 01:03:32.610
Stop fighting! Stop it!


01:03:32.611 --> 01:03:33.943
Stop fighting!


01:03:38.249 --> 01:03:41.032
Stop fighting!
Stop fighting!


01:03:41.033 --> 01:03:42.155
Come on!


01:03:42.156 --> 01:03:44.583
Back off!
Everybody, stop it!


01:03:46.285 --> 01:03:49.128
Stop it! Stop fighting!


01:03:51.766 --> 01:03:55.435
Stop it! Stop fighting!


01:03:57.404 --> 01:03:59.035
Leung...


01:03:59.036 --> 01:04:00.060
Master


01:04:00.061 --> 01:04:01.374
Carry him down first.


01:04:01.375 --> 01:04:03.040
Help me, Cham.


01:04:03.041 --> 01:04:04.385
Slowly... slowly...


01:04:04.386 --> 01:04:07.225
Excuse me...
Slowly!


01:04:07.942 --> 01:04:09.569
Let us pass!


01:04:16.077 --> 01:04:17.804
Master of Ceremony!
Come here!


01:04:20.787 --> 01:04:22.450
We were demonstrating
Chinese martial arts.


01:04:22.451 --> 01:04:24.245
If you didn't like it,
you could have left.


01:04:24.246 --> 01:04:27.448
But you should apologize
for injuring us!


01:04:27.449 --> 01:04:29.242
He wants you to apologize.


01:04:29.243 --> 01:04:31.676
What? Apologize?


01:04:31.677 --> 01:04:34.846
What is this some stupid
Chinese tradition,


01:04:34.847 --> 01:04:37.826
that winners have to
apologize to the losers?


01:04:37.827 --> 01:04:41.663
If I have to do that,
I'd be apologizing everyday!


01:04:45.806 --> 01:04:48.579
You want an apology
from me, old man?


01:04:48.719 --> 01:04:52.518
Then you beat me
in a fight right now,


01:04:53.010 --> 01:04:55.369
then I'll apologize.


01:04:55.606 --> 01:04:58.261
He said, if Master Hung
can beat him,


01:04:58.262 --> 01:04:59.542
then he'll apologize.


01:04:59.543 --> 01:05:01.040
Let me fight with him!


01:05:01.113 --> 01:05:03.036
I'll beat him till he
apologizes to me!


01:05:03.037 --> 01:05:04.606
Slay that Foreign Devil!


01:05:04.607 --> 01:05:08.059
Masters, let me handle this.


01:05:08.771 --> 01:05:10.975
Please get down
for the moment.


01:05:11.204 --> 01:05:14.276
OK! Let's get down!


01:05:33.372 --> 01:05:34.800
Fight!


01:05:54.608 --> 01:05:58.127
Good!


01:06:02.840 --> 01:06:05.296
Right! Fight like that!


01:06:24.686 --> 01:06:27.057
Stop! To your corner!


01:06:27.058 --> 01:06:29.232
Break! Break!


01:06:34.198 --> 01:06:35.895
Very well.


01:06:35.896 --> 01:06:38.460
Master Ip. Leung is all right.
He's resting inside.


01:06:38.461 --> 01:06:39.890
Thanks!


01:06:44.931 --> 01:06:47.556
Master Hung!...


01:06:47.557 --> 01:06:49.370
Are you all right?


01:06:50.184 --> 01:06:52.062
I'm fine.


01:06:53.514 --> 01:06:55.372
In the next round,
Master Hung,


01:06:55.373 --> 01:06:58.572
instead of combating with him,
test his midrib.


01:07:01.139 --> 01:07:03.314
It's not that easy.


01:07:08.570 --> 01:07:10.677
OK. Go for it.


01:07:10.811 --> 01:07:12.374
Fight!


01:07:21.607 --> 01:07:23.201
Kick the Foreign Devil down!


01:07:44.925 --> 01:07:46.738
Break! Break!


01:07:49.250 --> 01:07:51.620
One, two,


01:07:51.621 --> 01:07:54.311
three, four,


01:07:54.312 --> 01:07:57.185
five, six,


01:07:57.258 --> 01:08:00.031
seven, eight,


01:08:00.172 --> 01:08:02.216
nine...


01:08:03.539 --> 01:08:05.682
Are you OK?
Look at me.


01:08:05.683 --> 01:08:07.311
Are you OK?


01:08:08.470 --> 01:08:11.378
- Me? Yeah!
- Fight!


01:08:32.526 --> 01:08:34.445
Break it up guys.
Break!


01:08:34.446 --> 01:08:35.878
Fight!


01:08:39.445 --> 01:08:43.256
One, two, three,


01:08:43.257 --> 01:08:46.063
four, five


01:08:49.438 --> 01:08:51.196
Are you alright?


01:08:51.234 --> 01:08:52.695
Fight!


01:08:53.666 --> 01:08:56.355
Shit! Master is out
of breath.


01:09:22.302 --> 01:09:24.248
Master, sit down
and rest a bit.


01:09:28.581 --> 01:09:30.110
Good.


01:09:35.018 --> 01:09:37.229
He's just getting tired. OK.


01:09:37.230 --> 01:09:39.044
Stop fighting,
Master Hung!


01:09:41.201 --> 01:09:43.861
I can't let the Foreign Devil
look down on us.


01:09:43.862 --> 01:09:46.101
Don't get hurt
for your ego!


01:09:46.165 --> 01:09:48.309
I can abide
in order to survive,


01:09:48.440 --> 01:09:51.096
but I can't let him insult
Chinese martial arts!


01:10:00.837 --> 01:10:02.498
Fight!


01:10:17.943 --> 01:10:19.191
Master! Master...


01:10:19.192 --> 01:10:22.960
One, two, three,


01:10:23.675 --> 01:10:25.271
four,


01:10:25.375 --> 01:10:28.825
five, six,


01:10:29.601 --> 01:10:31.202
seven,


01:10:31.203 --> 01:10:32.733
eight,


01:10:33.030 --> 01:10:34.689
nine!


01:10:35.205 --> 01:10:37.114
Master!


01:10:37.892 --> 01:10:40.615
- Master!
- Are you OK?


01:10:41.134 --> 01:10:42.761
Fight!


01:11:34.113 --> 01:11:35.458
Let go!
Master...


01:11:35.459 --> 01:11:37.338
Let go!


01:11:39.816 --> 01:11:41.410
Master...


01:12:43.626 --> 01:12:46.081
Go home, boys!


01:13:52.620 --> 01:13:54.402
Master Hung,


01:13:56.496 --> 01:14:00.143
you're my most
respected master.


01:14:22.794 --> 01:14:24.300
Hung Kuen Grandmaster Died
in Western Boxing Match


01:14:24.301 --> 01:14:26.286
Hung Kuen Grandmaster Died
For His Country.


01:14:26.287 --> 01:14:29.743
Western Boxing Champion
Was a Bully.


01:14:29.744 --> 01:14:33.783
Wallace! You've seen what the
local newspapers saying about us?


01:14:33.784 --> 01:14:38.137
I ask you to organize one,
one boxing competition.


01:14:38.138 --> 01:14:40.537
And look at the trouble
you got us in!


01:14:40.538 --> 01:14:42.206
I'm sorry, Sir.
I know what to do.


01:14:42.207 --> 01:14:43.649
I'll take care of it.


01:14:43.650 --> 01:14:44.639
You'll take care of it?


01:14:44.640 --> 01:14:46.369
You'd better take care of this.


01:14:46.370 --> 01:14:51.197
I do not want to be in the newspaper
once more for bullying the Chinese!


01:14:51.528 --> 01:14:53.352
It's alright, sir.


01:14:53.353 --> 01:14:56.707
I promise. We will have
no further trouble from them.


01:15:01.617 --> 01:15:03.944
- What's going on?
- Sit tight!


01:15:04.627 --> 01:15:06.889
None of your business.
Sit down.


01:15:13.439 --> 01:15:15.350
Who's the editor-in-chief?


01:15:17.761 --> 01:15:18.721
What's the matter?


01:15:18.722 --> 01:15:19.876
Take him back.


01:15:19.877 --> 01:15:21.472
Sir!


01:15:24.520 --> 01:15:26.180
Open up.


01:15:28.429 --> 01:15:33.063
You'd better remember that this is what
happens to people who mess with me.


01:15:36.019 --> 01:15:37.582
Hold his hands!


01:15:39.988 --> 01:15:43.663
No...


01:15:44.989 --> 01:15:46.800
Hold him tight!


01:15:48.161 --> 01:15:52.028
Sir...


01:15:53.541 --> 01:15:57.125
It's not wise to beat him like that.
He will write a scathing report on us.


01:15:57.738 --> 01:15:59.401
We better waste him.


01:15:59.402 --> 01:16:01.215
I know what to do.
Let me handle it.


01:16:01.710 --> 01:16:05.585
Fatso! You take care of him!


01:16:05.586 --> 01:16:07.082
OK.


01:16:39.922 --> 01:16:44.761
There had been a lot of rumor
in Hong Kong recently.


01:16:44.762 --> 01:16:49.141
This is due to a boxing competition
that had been arranged.


01:16:49.629 --> 01:16:54.914
Unfortunately, a Chinese boxer
rather over-estimated himself


01:16:54.915 --> 01:16:58.237
and challenged our champion.


01:16:58.341 --> 01:17:01.863
Twister reluctantly accepted
the challenge,


01:17:01.864 --> 01:17:05.450
and although he held back
during the fight.


01:17:05.451 --> 01:17:09.135
Unfortunately the Chinese boxer
was so weak


01:17:09.136 --> 01:17:12.244
that he couldn't stand up
to Twister's fists.


01:17:12.245 --> 01:17:17.202
And after a few punches,
he tragically died.


01:17:17.369 --> 01:17:21.466
We are sorry for this
regrettable accident.


01:17:22.460 --> 01:17:25.823
To quell this riot and
give Twister justice,


01:17:25.824 --> 01:17:32.924
I have decided to organize a
Chinese-western boxing competition.


01:17:33.927 --> 01:17:37.133
Twister will fight the Chinese people


01:17:37.134 --> 01:17:39.856
in a fair manner on the stage.


01:17:39.857 --> 01:17:44.945
In order to protect my name
and reputation,


01:17:45.848 --> 01:17:50.323
I've agreed to fight
any Chinese person.


01:17:51.291 --> 01:17:53.586
Nowfrom what I hear,


01:17:53.821 --> 01:17:57.918
the Chinese like to use this!


01:17:58.913 --> 01:18:02.651
And I would like to
stick to that tradition.


01:18:03.144 --> 01:18:08.395
So I've agreed to fight
any challenger


01:18:08.396 --> 01:18:11.978
for as long as
this thing burns!


01:18:12.369 --> 01:18:14.449
And this is a pretty
big joss stick,


01:18:14.450 --> 01:18:18.579
so it's gonna give plenty of opportunity
for any challenger to come forward.


01:18:18.678 --> 01:18:21.004
But be warned!


01:18:21.177 --> 01:18:23.730
I would not hold back!


01:18:23.834 --> 01:18:27.103
By the time this thing
has burnt to the end,


01:18:27.104 --> 01:18:31.713
there will be no more Chinese boxer,
because I'd have kill them all!


01:18:31.714 --> 01:18:34.275
In fact I don't even think
that we're gonna use this thing


01:18:34.276 --> 01:18:38.120
because I doubt that there
is any Chinese fella


01:18:38.121 --> 01:18:41.573
that has the guts to get
in the ring with me!


01:18:44.656 --> 01:18:47.245
Chinese burns incense not
only to tell the time!


01:18:52.408 --> 01:18:54.393
Besides telling the time,
what's important


01:18:54.394 --> 01:18:56.602
about the Chinese tradition
of incense burning


01:18:57.470 --> 01:19:00.057
is that it represents
our modesty


01:19:00.254 --> 01:19:02.396
which is inherent to the
Chinese culture.


01:19:04.675 --> 01:19:06.522
Mr Miller,


01:19:07.784 --> 01:19:09.860
I'm challenging you
to a fight!


01:19:13.550 --> 01:19:16.007
You're making a big mistake!


01:19:44.397 --> 01:19:45.807
Zhun, hurry up.


01:19:45.808 --> 01:19:47.979
Don't let the Landlady
wait too long.


01:19:48.944 --> 01:19:51.205
I'll take you
there in a moment.


01:20:13.482 --> 01:20:17.511
Mom, why are we staying
with the landlady?


01:20:17.740 --> 01:20:20.679
Dad's practice will affect
your brother.


01:20:24.839 --> 01:20:25.810
Come, let me.


01:20:25.811 --> 01:20:27.125
I'm so sorry for the hassle,
Landlady.


01:20:27.126 --> 01:20:28.533
- Don't worry. Come.
- Thanks.


01:20:28.534 --> 01:20:29.910
Let Zhun
carry the small one.


01:20:29.911 --> 01:20:31.512
Zhun.
Let Zhun carry this.


01:20:31.513 --> 01:20:34.235
Mr Ip, you must defeat
the Foreign Devil.


01:20:34.236 --> 01:20:36.213
I'll carry it up first.


01:20:52.559 --> 01:20:55.563
Don't worry and
practice well.


01:20:56.405 --> 01:20:58.380
But don't practice
till too late.


01:20:58.516 --> 01:21:00.492
You have to win.


01:21:06.012 --> 01:21:07.794
We have to go.


01:21:08.481 --> 01:21:10.238
Go back.


01:21:22.894 --> 01:21:24.718
I live by myself.


01:21:24.719 --> 01:21:26.533
Make yourselves at home.


01:21:27.410 --> 01:21:29.289
You can sleep here.


01:21:44.453 --> 01:21:46.623
Don't be scared.
Keep writing.


01:21:47.430 --> 01:21:50.083
Keep writing!
I'll still publish it tomorrow!


01:21:55.631 --> 01:21:57.071
What's the matter?


01:21:57.072 --> 01:21:58.698
Cops!


01:22:00.720 --> 01:22:02.504
What are you writing?


01:22:02.774 --> 01:22:04.436
Still writing?


01:22:04.437 --> 01:22:06.351
You're not afraid to die?


01:22:08.732 --> 01:22:11.068
Undaunted by Western Boxer,
Wing Chun Expert...


01:22:11.069 --> 01:22:12.703
Entered Chinese-Western Boxing Competiti


01:22:12.704 --> 01:22:14.301
Is that good?


01:22:14.786 --> 01:22:17.559
Why not "Western Dog
Will Be Demolished"?


01:22:23.112 --> 01:22:26.540
Defend news with blood,
expose truth with conscience.


01:22:26.541 --> 01:22:28.749
You have conscience,
but do you have the truth?


01:22:28.750 --> 01:22:30.530
I do!


01:22:31.378 --> 01:22:34.763
You've guts? I tell you the truth.
You ruin him!


01:22:35.381 --> 01:22:37.195
Good!
Come.


01:22:37.304 --> 01:22:38.746
This Foreign Devil...


01:22:38.747 --> 01:22:41.366
detests and despises Chinese.


01:22:41.405 --> 01:22:43.896
I give you the materials. You report them.
I guarantee he'll be over.


01:23:09.269 --> 01:23:10.261
What's the matter?


01:23:10.262 --> 01:23:11.513
Mrs Ip, what's the matter?


01:23:11.514 --> 01:23:12.538
You're in labor!


01:23:12.539 --> 01:23:13.788
Zhun, call your dad
right away!


01:23:13.789 --> 01:23:16.882
Zhun...
Don't distract him.


01:23:17.022 --> 01:23:18.240
I'll ask Auntie to come then.


01:23:18.241 --> 01:23:20.219
Zhun, watch over your mom.


01:23:39.031 --> 01:23:40.874
This way, Master Cheng.


01:23:41.659 --> 01:23:42.956
Let's start!


01:23:47.069 --> 01:23:50.016
The Chinese-Western Boxing Match
is about to commence!


01:23:50.017 --> 01:23:52.673
The hall is packed with
locals and foreigners.


01:23:52.674 --> 01:23:54.308
It's bustling with excitement.


01:23:54.309 --> 01:23:57.384
There are both Chinese
and Western umpires.


01:23:57.385 --> 01:23:59.336
I believe the match
will be fair,


01:23:59.337 --> 01:24:00.841
just and open.


01:24:00.842 --> 01:24:02.539
Ladies and gentlemen,
do not leave your radio!


01:24:02.540 --> 01:24:04.619
Ip Man, knock him down
in 3 punches.


01:24:04.620 --> 01:24:07.211
No, knock the Foreign Devil
down in 3 punches!


01:24:08.019 --> 01:24:10.066
Master Ip, your opponent
is a boxing champion.


01:24:10.067 --> 01:24:12.207
Are you convinced your
Wing Chun will prevail?


01:24:12.214 --> 01:24:14.543
Master Ip, all Hong Kong
citizens are behind you.


01:24:15.002 --> 01:24:16.858
Master Ip, are you fighting
for yourself...


01:24:16.859 --> 01:24:17.883
or in defense of Chinese
martial arts?


01:24:17.884 --> 01:24:19.774
Ladies and gentlemen...


01:24:19.775 --> 01:24:22.399
The most awaited
Chinese-Western Boxing Match...


01:24:22.400 --> 01:24:25.307
has officially commenced!


01:24:25.349 --> 01:24:27.205
Ladies and gentlemen!


01:24:27.206 --> 01:24:31.881
And now, for the long-awaited
Chinese-western boxing tournament,


01:24:31.882 --> 01:24:37.294
please, give a roaring welcome to the
undisputed champion oft he world!


01:24:37.295 --> 01:24:40.465
The Twister!


01:24:40.466 --> 01:24:45.688
Let's welcome
the boxing champion, Twister!


01:24:45.689 --> 01:24:48.178
Twister has come on stage.


01:24:49.948 --> 01:24:52.123
You are the best.


01:25:37.228 --> 01:25:39.213
Excuse me, sir, to your corner.


01:25:39.214 --> 01:25:42.600
Here, to your corner, please.


01:25:47.315 --> 01:25:49.163
To your corner!


01:25:49.399 --> 01:25:52.401
Ip Man was eager to knock
him down. Good!


01:25:56.607 --> 01:25:58.267
Master.


01:25:58.303 --> 01:26:03.679
Twister.


01:26:09.357 --> 01:26:11.405
Gentlemen, I want a clean fight.


01:26:11.406 --> 01:26:12.880
I want a clean fight.


01:26:12.881 --> 01:26:14.226
When I say "fight", fight.


01:26:14.227 --> 01:26:15.345
When I say "fight", fight.


01:26:15.346 --> 01:26:16.528
When I say "break", break.


01:26:16.529 --> 01:26:17.940
When I say "break", break.


01:26:17.941 --> 01:26:21.111
You have to follow my instructions
at all time, is that clear?


01:26:21.112 --> 01:26:23.405
You have to follow my instructions
at all time, is that clear?


01:26:24.315 --> 01:26:27.101
I can finish you off
in two punches!


01:26:27.102 --> 01:26:28.979
Return to your corners!


01:26:30.559 --> 01:26:32.709
This should be a piece
of cake, mate.


01:26:32.710 --> 01:26:34.813
You just go up there
and get him slaughtered.


01:26:46.311 --> 01:26:47.658
Fight!


01:26:53.079 --> 01:26:56.564
Master Ip, punch him like you
punched me.


01:26:56.828 --> 01:26:58.042
It's too easy to punch you.


01:26:58.043 --> 01:26:59.574
What did you say?


01:27:02.784 --> 01:27:05.176
They keep testing each other.


01:27:08.551 --> 01:27:10.048
Come on!


01:27:57.751 --> 01:27:59.256
To your corner!
To your corner!


01:27:59.257 --> 01:28:00.216
Master!


01:28:00.217 --> 01:28:02.620
Master Ip was knocked down!
The umpire's counting!


01:28:02.621 --> 01:28:04.247
Master!


01:28:04.926 --> 01:28:06.881
One, two, three...
Get up! Master Ip!


01:28:06.882 --> 01:28:08.002
Looks like this punch
was too strong.


01:28:08.003 --> 01:28:09.187
Can Master Ip stand up?


01:28:09.188 --> 01:28:11.840
four, five...


01:28:12.232 --> 01:28:14.728
six, seven...


01:28:14.729 --> 01:28:18.081
eight, nine...


01:28:20.014 --> 01:28:21.806
Master Ip is OK!
He's stood up!


01:28:21.807 --> 01:28:23.205
Good!


01:28:26.101 --> 01:28:27.663
Good!


01:28:33.629 --> 01:28:35.089
Fight!


01:28:55.058 --> 01:28:58.255
Master Ip has kicked
the Twister down!


01:29:01.238 --> 01:29:03.600
One, two...


01:29:03.675 --> 01:29:06.330
three, four...


01:29:06.331 --> 01:29:09.022
five, six...


01:29:09.023 --> 01:29:10.582
seven...


01:29:12.579 --> 01:29:14.392
Are you OK?


01:29:44.035 --> 01:29:45.409
OK?


01:29:45.410 --> 01:29:47.224
Fight!


01:29:48.357 --> 01:29:50.980
Get back! Back to your corner!
To your corner!


01:29:56.365 --> 01:29:57.806
He's over.
You can surely beat him.


01:29:57.807 --> 01:29:59.280
Master! Good fight!


01:29:59.281 --> 01:30:00.335
That Foreign Devil
has stamina.


01:30:00.336 --> 01:30:02.893
He's endured many ofthe
Master's punches.


01:30:07.833 --> 01:30:09.363
Fight!


01:30:24.906 --> 01:30:27.298
Master Ip attacked with
a volley of punches.


01:30:27.887 --> 01:30:33.873
Master Ip! Master Ip...


01:31:01.453 --> 01:31:02.511
Master!


01:31:02.512 --> 01:31:03.889
Foreign Devil!
Still hitting after time's up?


01:31:03.890 --> 01:31:05.898
To your corner!


01:31:06.964 --> 01:31:09.619
That's unfair!
He kept hitting after time's up!


01:31:11.930 --> 01:31:14.225
Come on,
give me some water.


01:31:14.428 --> 01:31:17.234
Master! Master...


01:31:18.655 --> 01:31:20.950
Talk about it.
What's going on?


01:31:21.155 --> 01:31:22.818
OK. Give me one moment.


01:31:22.819 --> 01:31:25.408
Brad, please,
could you come?


01:31:42.198 --> 01:31:45.619
Please tell the Chinese guy,
no more kicks like these.


01:31:59.910 --> 01:32:02.090
According to the decisions
by the judges,


01:32:02.091 --> 01:32:04.588
kicking is prohibited
in this match.


01:32:04.589 --> 01:32:06.446
According to the decisions
by the judges,


01:32:06.447 --> 01:32:08.177
kicking is prohibited
in this match.


01:32:08.178 --> 01:32:10.706
If you don't agree,
you forfeit the match.


01:32:10.707 --> 01:32:13.751
And Twister will be announced
the winner. Is that clear?


01:32:13.752 --> 01:32:15.894
If you don't agree,
you forfeit the match.


01:32:15.895 --> 01:32:19.383
And Twister will be announced
the winner. Is that clear?


01:32:19.709 --> 01:32:23.160
Are you kidding?
No kicking?


01:32:32.521 --> 01:32:34.051
Fight!


01:32:40.816 --> 01:32:42.291
Wait! Wait! Wait!


01:32:42.292 --> 01:32:44.247
One more kick,
you'll be disqualified!


01:32:44.248 --> 01:32:45.586
Understand?


01:32:45.587 --> 01:32:46.898
Fight!


01:32:58.114 --> 01:33:02.364
Master Ip was knocked out
by Twister's right punch!


01:33:02.985 --> 01:33:04.455
Master!


01:33:04.456 --> 01:33:09.454
Get up! Get up!
Get up!


01:33:09.455 --> 01:33:11.429
Stand up! Master!


01:33:11.568 --> 01:33:14.737
I can't let the Foreign Devil
despise us!


01:33:14.899 --> 01:33:17.322
I can abide in order
to survive,


01:33:17.654 --> 01:33:19.639
but I can't tolerate insults to
Chinese martial arts!


01:33:19.640 --> 01:33:23.066
...three, four...


01:33:23.067 --> 01:33:25.599
five, six...


01:33:25.600 --> 01:33:26.559
Master!


01:33:26.560 --> 01:33:28.283
seven...


01:33:29.793 --> 01:33:31.739
Are you OK?


01:33:31.843 --> 01:33:33.888
Are you OK?


01:33:35.592 --> 01:33:37.130
Let's go!


01:33:37.131 --> 01:33:38.595
Fight!


01:33:43.379 --> 01:33:44.971
Come on, man!


01:33:46.386 --> 01:33:48.371
Instead of combating
with him,


01:33:48.372 --> 01:33:49.718
test his midrib.


01:33:49.719 --> 01:33:51.380
It's not that easy.


01:35:00.507 --> 01:35:02.103
One!


01:35:02.687 --> 01:35:04.320
Two!


01:35:04.321 --> 01:35:05.954
Three!


01:35:05.955 --> 01:35:07.524
Four!


01:35:07.525 --> 01:35:09.061
Five!


01:35:09.062 --> 01:35:10.309
Six!


01:35:10.310 --> 01:35:11.427
Seven!


01:35:11.428 --> 01:35:12.425
- Eight!
- Get up!


01:35:12.426 --> 01:35:15.113
Nine! Ten!


01:35:23.314 --> 01:35:25.140
Dad has won!
Dad has won!


01:35:25.141 --> 01:35:26.637
Fantastic!


01:35:59.671 --> 01:36:01.304
I know Master Ip!


01:36:01.305 --> 01:36:02.554
Who doesn't here?


01:36:02.555 --> 01:36:05.277
Fok Yuen Kap, Wong Fei Hung,
Ip Man and I!


01:36:05.278 --> 01:36:06.938
We're the Four Dragons
in Foshan!


01:36:15.463 --> 01:36:16.992
Stop.


01:36:18.891 --> 01:36:21.004
Fatso has told
me everything.


01:36:21.005 --> 01:36:25.551
Your actions embarrassed the entire
Hong Kong Police Force!


01:36:25.841 --> 01:36:27.504
Arrest him!


01:36:43.076 --> 01:36:44.921
Hello!


01:36:45.095 --> 01:36:47.301
He says "Hello".


01:36:49.834 --> 01:36:51.909
By fighting this match,


01:36:53.100 --> 01:36:56.073
I'm not trying to prove
Chinese martial arts


01:36:56.529 --> 01:36:59.083
are better than
Western boxing.


01:37:01.524 --> 01:37:03.733
What I really
want to say is...


01:37:05.078 --> 01:37:09.747
though people have different
statuses in life,


01:37:12.098 --> 01:37:17.504
everybody's dignity is the same.


01:37:18.952 --> 01:37:22.882
I hope that from
this moment on,


01:37:25.293 --> 01:37:29.388
we can start to respect
each other.


01:37:31.379 --> 01:37:34.613
He says he didn't come here today
to prove which is better,


01:37:34.614 --> 01:37:36.696
Chinese or western boxing.


01:37:36.697 --> 01:37:39.484
Although people have different
status in life,


01:37:39.485 --> 01:37:44.630
he doesn't believe that one person's
integrity is worth more than another's.


01:37:44.705 --> 01:37:48.506
He hopes that we could start
to respect each other.


01:37:52.904 --> 01:37:55.678
That's all.
Thank you!


01:37:55.949 --> 01:37:58.273
That's all,
Thank you!


01:38:16.254 --> 01:38:18.462
Master Ip! Master Ip...


01:38:18.948 --> 01:38:21.087
What would you want to
do most right now?


01:38:23.175 --> 01:38:25.567
I want to go home.


01:39:07.668 --> 01:39:09.646
He takes after you.


01:39:12.024 --> 01:39:13.752
Name him.


01:39:13.753 --> 01:39:15.484
How about Ip Ching?


01:39:15.485 --> 01:39:17.852
I want him to become
a righteous man.


01:39:17.853 --> 01:39:19.481
Good!


01:39:19.487 --> 01:39:21.246
He looks just like you!


01:39:29.640 --> 01:39:32.645
Congratulations, Master Ip!
You won!


01:39:48.317 --> 01:39:50.974
Uncle Man, I just made
a new friend.


01:39:50.975 --> 01:39:53.472
He wants to learn kung fu,
so I brought him.


01:39:53.473 --> 01:39:55.286
Come in.


01:39:59.685 --> 01:40:02.373
How much to learn
martial arts from you?


01:40:10.673 --> 01:40:11.923
What's your name?


01:40:11.924 --> 01:40:13.803
Bruce Lee!


01:40:14.999 --> 01:40:16.950
Why do you want to
learn martial arts?


01:40:16.951 --> 01:40:19.825
I wanna beat up people
I don't fancy!


01:40:21.727 --> 01:40:23.602
How presumptious!


01:40:25.535 --> 01:40:28.824
Come back when
you've grown up.


01:40:44.627 --> 01:40:46.674
In 1956


01:40:46.675 --> 01:40:50.447
16-year-old Bruce Lee
became Ip Man's pupil


01:40:51.067 --> 01:40:53.915
Bruce Lee was
deeply inspired


01:40:53.916 --> 01:40:56.825
and based his martial arts
on Wing Chun theories.


01:40:57.666 --> 01:40:59.681
In 22 years' time,
Ip Man


01:40:59.682 --> 01:41:03.551
had spread Wing Chun
all over the world,


01:41:04.102 --> 01:41:06.889
helping Chinese martial arts


01:41:06.890 --> 01:41:10.372
to flourish everywhere.

